-{#x} an attributed bullet

*{.c} an attributed star bullet

-{} an empty block attaches nothing

-{not attrs} bare keys are two boolean attributes

-{title="a}b"} a brace inside a quoted value

-{.c} [x] a task item carrying a class

-{#x}

-{#x}{.y} two glued blocks are prose even with content

-{+a+} an insertion span is not attributes

-{2=v} a digit-first key is not an attribute

-{a:b} a colon is not an identifier character
